WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.673 --> 00:00:13.154
poked her head into the computer center.

2
00:00:13.174 --> 00:00:15.475
"I'll be back soon, Miss Apricot.

3
00:00:16.195 --> 00:00:17.636
I need to help Principal Penn."

4
00:00:18.897 --> 00:00:20.378
Roxy glanced at Terrell and nodded.

5
00:00:20.938 --> 00:00:21.658
He nodded back.

6
00:00:23.399 --> 00:00:25.861
Then Roxy ran out of the school and shot into the air.

7
00:00:28.962 --> 00:00:31.644
She found Detective Smith inside Metro City Central Bank.

8
00:00:32.224 --> 00:00:33.785
The door to the bank safe was open.

9
00:00:34.465 --> 00:00:35.725
The detective was knocking on it.

10
00:00:36.825 --> 00:00:37.506
Roxy grinned.

11
00:00:37.526 --> 00:00:39.866
"The door is open, Detective.

12
00:00:40.527 --> 00:00:41.647
You don't have to knock."

13
00:00:42.807 --> 00:00:44.768
"Very funny, Rocket Girl."

14
00:00:45.068 --> 00:00:46.188
Detective Smith frowned.

15
00:00:46.208 --> 00:00:48.909
"I'm wondering how the thief got into the safe."

16
00:00:50.029 --> 00:00:52.010
The bank teller stood behind Detective Smith.

17
00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:54.551
"It doesn't make any sense.

18
00:00:55.291 --> 00:00:56.531
The safe isn't broken.

19
00:00:57.271 --> 00:00:58.752
There's no hole in the wall.

20
00:00:59.608 --> 00:01:02.049
I don't understand how someone stole the money!"

21
00:01:02.070 --> 00:01:04.731
"Did you see anyone suspicious?"

22
00:01:05.131 --> 00:01:05.852
Roxy asked.

23
00:01:06.612 --> 00:01:07.653
The teller shook his head.

24
00:01:07.673 --> 00:01:11.635
"There are no clues," Detective Smith said.

25
00:01:11.655 --> 00:01:13.496
"This is very odd."

26
00:01:14.336 --> 00:01:15.537
Just then his phone rang.

27
00:01:15.557 --> 00:01:19.019
"Hello? Uh-oh.

28
00:01:19.359 --> 00:01:20.259
We're on our way!"

29
00:01:21.200 --> 00:01:22.581
Detective Smith looked at Roxy.

30
00:01:22.601 --> 00:01:24.862
"True Savings Bank was just robbed.

31
00:01:24.982 --> 00:01:27.343
We need to—Rocket Girl?"

32
00:01:28.944 --> 00:01:32.465
Zoom! Roxy flew to True Savings Bank and rushed inside.

33
00:01:33.805 --> 00:01:34.626
A woman ran over.

34
00:01:34.646 --> 00:01:36.306
"Rocket Girl!

35
00:01:36.686 --> 00:01:37.746
I'm glad you're here.

36
00:01:37.766 --> 00:01:39.307
I'm Mrs.

37
00:01:39.387 --> 00:01:40.847
Betz, the bank manager.

38
00:01:41.667 --> 00:01:43.108
We were just robbed!"

39
00:01:43.128 --> 00:01:46.069
"Yes, I know," Roxy said.

40
00:01:46.089 --> 00:01:47.989
"Did you see the robber?"

41
00:01:48.949 --> 00:01:49.890
Mrs. Betz nodded.

42
00:01:49.910 --> 00:01:51.770
"I saw her escape."

43
00:01:52.690 --> 00:01:54.071
Roxy ran back to the door.

44
00:01:54.091 --> 00:01:55.931
"Which way did she go?"

45
00:01:56.752 --> 00:01:57.732
Mrs. Betz sighed.

46
00:01:59.112 --> 00:02:00.754
"She didn't go out the door.

47
00:02:00.934 --> 00:02:03.536
She—" Detective Smith ran into the bank.

48
00:02:03.557 --> 00:02:05.538
"Are we too late?"

49
00:02:06.359 --> 00:02:07.620
"Yes," Roxy said.

50
00:02:07.640 --> 00:02:09.322
"But luckily, Mrs.

51
00:02:09.402 --> 00:02:10.503
Betz saw the robber."

52
00:02:11.424 --> 00:02:13.105
Roxy turned back to the bank manager.

53
00:02:13.125 --> 00:02:14.707
"Tell us what you saw."

54
00:02:16.368 --> 00:02:19.031
Mrs. Betz led Roxy and Detective Smith into a safe.

55
00:02:21.713 --> 00:02:24.136
"It sounds ridiculous," she said.

56
00:02:25.048 --> 00:02:28.851
"But there was a spinning, glowing hole right here in the wall.

57
00:02:30.192 --> 00:02:33.314
A woman was grabbing money and throwing it into the hole.

58
00:02:34.154 --> 00:02:36.556
I told her to stop, but she ignored me.

59
00:02:37.457 --> 00:02:38.918
She threw the rest of the money in.

60
00:02:39.818 --> 00:02:43.040
Then she jumped into the hole, and the hole disappeared.

61
00:02:44.862 --> 00:02:47.023
Now it's a solid wall again."

62
00:02:47.043 --> 00:02:50.265
"Hmm." Roxy knocked on the wall.

63
00:02:50.285 --> 00:02:52.787
"Maybe it was a wormhole."

64
00:02:52.807 --> 00:02:55.317
"Huh?" Detective Smith said.

65
00:02:55.337 --> 00:02:57.879
"A wormhole," Roxy said.

66
00:02:57.899 --> 00:03:00.280
"It's like a tunnel through space.

67
00:03:01.041 --> 00:03:02.662
It connects two different places.

68
00:03:03.663 --> 00:03:05.464
I didn't think wormholes were real though."

69
00:03:06.525 --> 00:03:08.126
Detective Smith's phone rang again.

70
00:03:08.146 --> 00:03:12.950
"Hello?" As he listened, the color drained from his face.

71
00:03:13.870 --> 00:03:15.551
He hung up the phone and looked at Roxy.

72
00:03:16.452 --> 00:03:17.733
Detective Smith swallowed.

73
00:03:17.753 --> 00:03:21.356
"Every bank in Metro City has been robbed!"
